  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of what **FedEx Express** and **FedEx.com** offer:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude9a FedEx Express & FedEx.com \u2014 Key Features\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 Shipping Services\nFedEx Express provides expedited shipping \u2014 a fast method for sending priority shipments that must reach their destination by a specific deadline, whether across town or globally, accommodating a range of items from individual envelopes and packages to palletized freight.\n\nAvailable FedEx Express services include **FedEx First Overnight\u00ae**, **FedEx Priority Overnight\u00ae**, **FedEx Standard Overnight\u00ae**, **FedEx 2Day\u00ae A.M.**, **FedEx 2Day\u00ae**, **FedEx Express Saver\u00ae**, as well as a variety of international options like **FedEx International Priority\u00ae** and **FedEx International Economy\u00ae**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe0 FedEx Home Delivery\nWith **FedEx Home Delivery**, you can get day-definite home delivery \u2014 even on evenings and Saturdays.\n\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers within **1\u20135 days** every day of the week, including Saturday and Sunday (excluding Hawaii and Alaska).\n\nFedEx Home Delivery delivers packages **150 lbs. or less** to residences every day of the week.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf0d International Shipping\nFedEx allows you to **expand your reach to 130+ countries and territories**. FedEx Global Air Freight gives you the support, visibility, and expertise you need to cross borders with confidence.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Flat-Rate Shipping\nWith **FedEx One Rate\u00ae**, you get flat-rate, 2-day shipping for packages up to **50 lbs.**\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf81 FedEx Rewards\nWhen you join **FedEx Rewards**, the extras start immediately \u2014 you'll get a **$10 gift card** for your first eligible shipment. Open a FedEx account to get started.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd0d Account & Tracking Tools\nYou can use **FedEx.com** to log in to your FedEx account, get your tracking status, find a FedEx near you, learn more about how to become a better shipper, get online print offers, or get inspiration for your small business needs.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Vacation Hold\nYou can place a **vacation hold** with FedEx Delivery Manager\u00ae for up to **14 days \u2014 for free!**\n\n---\n\nYou can visit **[www.fedex.com](https://www.fedex.com/en-us/home.html)** to ship, track packages, find locations, and manage your account. Is there anything specific you'd like help with regarding FedEx services?",
